      "descEn": "<table style=\"width: 95%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"5\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"95%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border-bottom: #ece9d8; border-left: #ece9d8; padding-bottom: 0cm; background- padding-left: 0cm; padding-right: 0cm; border-top: #ece9d8; border-right: #ece9d8; padding-top: 0cm\"><div align=\"left\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\">BOPP anti-fog film</span></b></div>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"border-bottom: #ece9d8; border-left: #ece9d8; padding-bottom: 0cm; background- padding-left: 0cm; padding-right: 0cm; border-top: #ece9d8; border-right: #ece9d8; padding-top: 0cm\">\n            <div><!--StartFragment--><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">BOPP anti-fog film treated on one or both sides to stop condensation from clouding the pack, keeping fresh produce, meat, seafood and frozen food clearly visible on the shelf. It retains BOPP's typical clarity, heat-seal strength and printability, and meets common food-contact requirements.</span><!--EndFragment--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\"><br>\n            Product performance: Excellent anti-fog and heat sealing \nproperties; high clearness; good puncture resistance performance; a high\n degree of transparency; be able to long-term preservation. <br>\n            Thickness : 20-60UM<br>\n            Width :200-2200MM<br>\n            Outer diameter :200-800MM</span></div>\n            <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\">Applications: Used for fresh vegetable, fish,fruit, susi ,flower and so forth .</span></div>\n            <div align=\"left\">&nbsp;</div></td></tr></tbody></table><!--EndFragment-->",
      "descZh": "BOPP防雾膜经单面或双面防雾处理，可有效防止包装内壁凝露起雾，让新鲜果蔬、肉类、海鲜及冷冻食品在货架上保持清晰可见。同时保留BOPP薄膜原有的透明度、热封强度和印刷适性，符合常见食品接触包装要求。",
      "nameEn": "Bopp Anti-Fog Film",
      "nameZh": "Bopp防雾薄膜",
