      "descEn": "<h2>BOPP anti-static film formulated so the sheet won't cling to itself or attract dust — pressed against a wall it slides off rather than sticking. It is well suited to wrapping textiles and other goods that are sensitive to static build-up and dust pickup during handling.<br><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\">BOPP anti static film is used for packing textile relative goods,and it won't stickup dust and atomy,&nbsp;<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\">and if your paste this sheets film on the wall , it won't stay on the wall , it will slip from the wall.&nbsp;<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\">bopp/bopet anti static film also called Polypropylene anti static film,bopp clothes packaging film,bopp bag&nbsp;<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\">usage film thickness : 25-38microns.&nbsp;<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\">width:500,650,700,750,800,850,900,950,1050 mm.... length:6000m,8000m...<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\">packing: every roll of bopp film is packed by special packing paper, pe mat and pe stuff. the thickness must&nbsp;<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\">be equal and the surface should be flat.</span></h2>",
      "descZh": "BOPP防静电膜经特殊处理，薄膜不会自吸附也不易粘附灰尘——即使贴在墙面上也会自然滑落而非附着。特别适合用于包装对静电和积尘敏感的纺织品及其他相关商品。",
