      "descEn": "<!--StartFragment--><span style=\"font-size: 20px\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman\">BOPP Bags<br>\nThickness: 20 25 26 30 35 microns。<br>\nSize:&nbsp;A4,10\" X 13\" (330MM+40MM)&nbsp; or any buyer's nominated sizes.<br>\nFeature: high super clear/transparent , high super brightness and can print any logos/brand/designs under buyer's requirement.&nbsp;<br>\nGlue: with&nbsp;self&nbsp;adhesive&nbsp;tape or no Glue at cap sealing&nbsp;<br>\n(&nbsp;in the envelop with official seal on the seal of envelop)&nbsp;<br>\nOutput :&nbsp;1000tons/month ( and about &nbsp;216270 pieces/bags from one ton film)</span></span><!--EndFragment-->",
