      "descEn": "<!--StartFragment--><div><font size=\"3\">BOPP clear rough film&nbsp;for capacitors<br>\n</font><font size=\"3\">Features:</font></div>\n<div><font size=\"3\">Impulse a deep-rough treatment into single side or \ndouble sides on the surface of the film in order &nbsp;to form some certain \nconcave ,then let the film be characteristic even roughness ,low \ndielectric loss, and high dielectric strength and good compatibility \nwith kinds of Dipping Oil but with small Swelling.</font></div>\n<div><font size=\"3\">Mainly used for Baptist paper composite membrane oil\n medium or total capacitor dielectric film Baptist Oil: such as \nhigh-voltage capacitor and capacitor for electric induction heating \nsystem,etc.</font></div>\n<div><font size=\"3\">Specification:</font></div>\n<div><font size=\"3\">Thickness: 6UM—15UM</font></div><!--EndFragment-->",
