      "descEn": "<h2>Metallized BOPP Capacitor Film (sliver)<br>Zinc/aluminium or pure aluminium metallized BOPP capacitor film with a reinforced heavy edge for improved corrosion resistance and safety/anti-explosion protection. Produced on ultra-clean electrical-grade resin and single-side corona treated, it suits AC/DC power capacitors that require self-healing performance.<br>Metallized BOPP Capacitor Film (sliver film) have two items :<br> \n1. Zn/Al Metallized BOPP Capacitor Film (sliver film)<br>\n2. Al Metallized BOPP Capacitor Film (sliver film)<br>\nreinforced edge ( of Aluminum/Zinc film ) are : 1.5,2.0,2.5 MM<br>\nThe standard thickness range including: 3,4,5,6,7,8,9,10,12 microns .<br>\nThe standard tolerance thickness: +/-0.2 Um .<br>\nThe standard width range including: 30,40,50,60,70,80,90,100,120,130 MM<br>\nThe standard tolerance width: +/-5 MM.<br>\nThe inner core : 3\" (76MM)<br>\nThe outer core: 150-350 MM .<br>\nFeatures:<br>\n1) single side corona treated for the Zn or Zn/Al metallized&nbsp;</h2><!--StartFragment-->\n<!--EndFragment-->",
      "descZh": "锌铝合金或纯铝金属化BOPP电容器膜，边缘加厚处理以提升抗腐蚀性，具备安全自愈（防爆）保护功能。采用超洁净电工级树脂生产，单面电晕处理，适用于要求自愈性能的交直流电力电容器。",
      "nameEn": "Bopp Metallized Capacitor Film (silver)",
      "nameZh": "Bopp镀银电容器薄膜",
      "status": "active",
      "category": "boppfilm-capacitor",
