      "descEn": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">BOPP&nbsp;Shrinkage Cigarette Film For Hard/Soft Tobacco&nbsp;Pack</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">BOPP cigarette packaging film is one of the most important series of BOPP film , which also festures the high-class quality . <br></span><!--StartFragment-->Shrinkage BOPP cigarette film that tightens down over hard or soft tobacco packs once heat is applied, giving cartons a crisp, tamper-evident wrap on high-speed shrink-wrapping lines. It keeps the low-haze clarity and anti-static behaviour of standard cigarette film while adding controlled shrink for a snug, wrinkle-free finish.<!--EndFragment--><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><br>\nThey were divided three items as : <br>\n1.Plain BOPP Cigarette Film with heat sealable matches slow/plain-speed packaging machines.<br>\n2.Half-shrinkage BOPP Cigarette Film with heat sealable matches high-speed packaging machines.<br>\n3.High-shrinkage BOPP Cigarette Film with heat sealable matches high-speed packaging machines.<br>\nThey are featuring high transparency, low haze and low static electricity. <br>\nIt has the property of superior low temperature heat sealability and \nhigh stiffness,transparency as well as slipping, and it is designed for \nthe various kinds of cigarette packaging machine, and it is used for the\n cigarette hard/soft unit packs or long packs which loading 10-boxes.</span></p><!--EndFragment--><div><br></div>",
      "descZh": "BOPP香烟收缩膜在加热后可紧密收缩包裹硬包或软包烟草，在高速收缩包装线上为烟条提供挺括、防拆封的外观。在保留标准香烟膜低雾度透明度与防静电性能的同时，具备可控收缩率，实现无褶皱的贴合效果。",
