      "descEn": "<h2 style=\"padding: 8px 0px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid;\"><span style=\"line-height: 36px; text-align: center;\">BOPP shrinkage cigarette sheets with tear tape</span><span style=\"line-height: 36px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px; \" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 27px;\">BOPP shrinkage cigarette film insert the tear tape for the tobacco cigarette pack wrapping .<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px; \" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 27px;\">Size : in sheets ( not in jumbo rolls or smaller rolls )&nbsp;<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px; \" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 27px;\">High transparency and gloss&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: center;\">BOPP shrinkage cigarette film supplied in cut sheets (not jumbo rolls) with an integrated tear tape insert for tobacco pack wrapping, available in multiple standard sheet sizes at 22 microns thickness with tear tape widths around 2mm, packed 1000 sheets per ream, 24 reams per carton.<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 27px;\">1. S1--- Size : 22 MICRONS *150 MM* 148 MM (37 MM+(insert) 2 MM tear tape + 109 MM .<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 27px;\">2. S2--- Size : 22 MICRONS *165 MM* 137 MM (43 MM+(insert) 2 MM tear tape + 92MM .<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 27px;\">3. S3--- Size : 22 MICRONS *150 MM* 127 MM (37 MM+(insert) 2 MM tear tape + 88 MM .&nbsp;<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 27px;\">4. S4--- Size : 22 MICRONS *151 MM* 99 MM (29 MM+(insert) 2 MM tear tape + 68 MM .&nbsp;<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 27px;\">5. S5--- Size : 22 MICRONS *166 MM* 119 MM (43 MM+(insert) 2 MM tear tape +74 MM .<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 27px;\">6. S6--- Size : 22 MICRONS *170MM * 120MM (42 MM+(insert) 1.7MM clear tear tape + 78MM.<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 27px;\">7. S7--- Size : 22 MICRONS *289MM * 345MM (100 MM+(insert) 2.0MM clear tear tape + 245MM.<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 27px;\">8. S8--- Size : 22 MICRONS *190MM * 130MM (46.5 MM+(insert) 2.0MM golden tear tape+81.5MM.<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 27px;\">9. S9--- Size : 22 MICRONS *700MM x 320MM (191 MM+(insert) 2.0MM golden tear tape +129MM.<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 27px;\">BOPP shrinkage cigarette&nbsp;<span data-mce-=\"\">sheets size:</span></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 27px;\">Customers can<span data-mce-=\"\">&nbsp;Customized any size</span>&nbsp;according to their own requirements.<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 27px;\"><span data-mce-style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px; \" style=\"line-height: 36px;\">package:&nbsp;</span>1000sheets/bag (ream) , 24 reams/carton .<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 24px; \" style=\"line-height: 36px;\">Application area:<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"text-decoration: underline;\" style=\"line-height: 18px;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 27px;\">BOPP cigarette tobacco film generally used for&nbsp;<span data-mce-style=\" text-decoration: underline; background-\">soft/hard tobacco pack&nbsp;</span>and used for modern high/slow packing machines.<br></span></span><span data-mce-style=\"text-decoration: underline;\" style=\"line-height: 18px;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 27px;\">Manual sheet membrane widely used in various items such as hand-packed square:&nbsp;<span data-mce-style=\" text-decoration: underline; background-\">sugar, condoms, VCD, Suoqi Ma, cosmetics, lipstick, and other notices posted.<br></span></span></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 24px; \" style=\"line-height: 36px;\">Widely\n used outside the cosmetics, pharmaceuticals, food, health supplies, \naudio and video products, stationery, daily necessities and other box \nCellophane skin packaging (the same effect with cigarette packaging).</span></h2><div>\n\n\n\n<strong><!--EndFragment--></strong></div>",
