      "descEn": "<div><h2>BOPP color printed film<br>Colour-printed BOPP flower wrapping film that carries branded patterns, logos or decorative designs directly on the film surface, letting florists and gift shops skip separate labelling while still showing the flowers through the clear background areas.<br>\n1.<br>\nBOPP color (logo) printed film in jumbo roll .&nbsp;<br>\nthickness : 20UM,25UM ,30UM,35UM,40UM<br>\n's own colored logos<br> \nwidth : 350MM/400MM/500MM/600MM/700MM/800MM/1000MM<br>\nlength : 1000M ,3000M,4000M,6000M&nbsp;<br>\nprinted sides : one surface printed ( printed on the corona treated \nside) ,Or printed twice on the same&nbsp;side ( printed on the&nbsp; corona \ntreated side once with one color , then printed on the&nbsp;same corona \ntreated side with one other different color again , then can get the two\n color on the&nbsp;double sides&nbsp;&nbsp;)<br>\ninner core :1.5 inch 1.8 inch ,2 inch ,3 inch,6 inch<br>\npackage : Standard exporting package ( with cartons and pallets ).<br>\nlogo designs: offered by customer or use our maintain designs .<br>\n2.<br>\nBOPP color (logo) printed film in&nbsp;mini-smaller roll .&nbsp;<br>\nthickness : 20UM,25UM ,30UM,35UM,40UM<br>\n's own colored logos<br> \nwidth : 350MM/400MM/500MM/600MM/700MM/800MM/1000MM<br>\nlength : 15M,30M,60M,100M,120M,200M,500M,1000M<br>\nprinted sides : one surface printed ( printed on the corona treated \nside) ,Or printed twice on the same&nbsp;side ( printed on the&nbsp; corona \ntreated side once with one color , then printed on the&nbsp;same corona \ntreated side with one other different color again , then can get the two\n color on the&nbsp;double sides&nbsp;&nbsp;)<br>\ninner core :1.5 inch 1.8 inch ,2 inch<br> \npackage : Standard exporting package ( with cartons and pallets ).<br>\nlogo designs: offered by customer or use our maintain designs .<br>\n3.<br>\nBOPP color (logo) printed film in&nbsp;cutting sheets ( pages)&nbsp;.&nbsp;<br>\nthickness : 20UM,25UM ,30UM,35UM,40UM<br>\n's own colored logos<br> \nwidth : 0.6M,0.8M,1.0M,1.2M<br>\nlength : 0.6M,0.8M,1.0M,1.1M,1.2M<br> \nprinted sides : one surface printed ( printed on the corona treated \nside) ,Or printed twice on the same&nbsp;side ( printed on the&nbsp; corona \ntreated side once with one color , then printed on the&nbsp;same corona \ntreated side with one other different color again , then can get the two\n color on the&nbsp;double sides&nbsp;&nbsp;)<br>\ninner core :1.5 inch 1.8 inch ,2 inch<br> \npackage : Standard exporting package ( with cartons and pallets ).<br>\nlogo designs: offered by customer or use our maintain designs .<br>\nSome logos for customer reference followings :&nbsp;</h2>\n<!--StartFragment-->\n<font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img border=\"0\" hspace=\"5\" alt=\"\" vspace=\"5\" width=\"557\" height=\"629\" src=\"http://boppfilmsale.com/pic/other/2013-01-30-22-48-538.jpg\"></span></font><br>\n<font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img border=\"0\" hspace=\"5\" alt=\"\" vspace=\"5\" width=\"557\" height=\"400\" src=\"http://boppfilmsale.com/pic/other/2013-01-30-22-49-080.jpg\"></span></font><br>\n<font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img border=\"0\" hspace=\"5\" alt=\"\" vspace=\"5\" width=\"446\" height=\"423\" src=\"http://boppfilmsale.com/pic/other/2013-01-30-22-49-170.jpg\"></span></font><br>\n<font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img border=\"0\" hspace=\"5\" alt=\"\" vspace=\"5\" width=\"476\" height=\"469\" src=\"http://boppfilmsale.com/pic/other/2013-01-30-22-49-287.jpg\"></span></font><br>\n<font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img border=\"0\" hspace=\"5\" alt=\"\" vspace=\"5\" width=\"446\" height=\"650\" src=\"http://boppfilmsale.com/pic/other/2013-01-30-22-49-400.jpg\"></span></font><!--EndFragment--></div>",
