      "descEn": "<h2 style=\"border: 0px; line-height: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p>Tip:  Each products have its own special,natural,outstanding soul!\n</p><p>One company (anhui eastern communication) offer tear tape products to the world market sufficiently.\n</p><p>Great largest market bone great largest enterprises, and great demand of BOPP tape all over the world pushs our company (anhui eastern communication) grewing largest scales. Global brand,surely and of course worthy you to buy. \n</p><p> \n</p><p>BOPP crystal adhesive tape jumbo rolls\n</p><p>BOPP crystal adhesive packing tape jumbo-rolls ( Bopp Transparent &amp; Brown Tapes acrylic water base size &amp; solvent &amp; rubber ) is widely used for slitting into medium/smaller rolls and for heavy-duty cartons sealing .\n</p><p>1) BOPP super clear adhesive packaging tape with water based acrylic adhesive, high-tensile strength and adhesion \n</p><p>BOPP adhesive tape also called Packing Sealing Adhesive Tapes,packing tape,adhesive tape,BOPP tape jumbo rolls,BOPP tan tape, BOPP brown tape,Polypropylene tape,BOPP clear tape, BOPP printed tape,BOPP brown tape,BOPP smaller rolls, BOPP water based tape, BOPP solvent based tape,BOPP rubber based tape,BOPP acrylic tape,BOPP crystal tape,BOPP jumbo rolls\n</p><p>2) Colors: Transparent/clear,tan,yellowish,red,dark brown,light tan,white,red,blue,green,black,multicolor and printed logo/letter so on. \n</p><p>3) Thickness: 35,36,38,39,40,41,42,45,48,50,53,55,58,60,63,65,68mic\n</p><p>4) Width: 520mm,980mm,1020mm,1270mm,1280mm,1300mm,1600mm,1620mm,and others \n</p><p>5) Length: 3000m,4000m,4500m,6000m\n</p><p>6.) Size:jumbo rolls tape \n</p><p>7.) Qty: 1200rolls/day\n</p><p>Customer own requirement is available for us. Such as : buyer's own printed OEM logos,private label,particular size and private package styles.\n</p><p> Two items of BOPP tape jumbo rolls :\n</p><p>1.  40Mic*1280MM*4000M\n</p><p>(thickness: 34,35,38,40,42,45,48,50,55,65Microns,\"line-height: 36px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\"&gt;Transparent/clear,tan,yellowish,red,dark brown,light tan,white,red,blue,green,black,multicolor and printed logo/letter so on.  )\n</p><p>2.  40Mic*1600MM*6000M   \n</p><p>(thickness: 34,35,38,40,42,45,48,50,55,65Microns,\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; line-height: 36px;\"&gt; Transparent/clear,tan,yellowish,red,dark brown,light tan,white,red,blue,green,black,multicolor and printed logo/letter so on.  )\n</p><p>5. Packing: carton and pallets (use cartons and kraft paper and bobble film to packing as inner package, and use pallets and wood board to packing as outer package)\n</p><p>Material: BOPP film + adhesive glue \n</p><p>BOPP film thickness are: 18,19,20,23,25,28,30,35,38 40 Microns\n</p><p>Adhesive tape : acrylic water base,slovent base and rubber base\n</p><p>Listen to us:\n</p><p>Here, you will get the real business for BOPP  tape, and from here, your BOPP tape business gets two wings, your BOPP tape business will be booming beyond your image from now on, and not able to stop but expanding continuously in future.\n</p><p>Just a choice of us, you get all !\n</p><p>Choose us, this is : your buyer's choose you too.\n</p><p>Choose us, this is: you chosse yourself and profit money choose you.\n</p><p>Who will win and laugh in BOPP  tape business lines at last? no doubt, it is you who choose us!\n</p><p>we can saw the world from just one roll BOPP  tape, because everywhere were the beauty, we just short for the eyes to find the beauty,but not no beauty.&nbsp;</p><p></p></h2>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<!--EndFragment-->",
      "descZh": "BOPP透明胶带母卷（货号：AEC_TAPE_CLEAR），透明及棕色胶带，水性丙烯酸胶及溶剂型胶水，广泛用于分切成中/小卷用于重型纸箱封箱。BOPP超透明包装胶带采用水性丙烯酸胶粘剂，高抗张强度和粘性。颜色：透明、茶色、米黄色、红色、深棕色、浅茶色、白色、混色及印刷logo。厚度：35-68微米。幅宽：980、1020、1270、1280、1635、1640毫米及其他规格。长度：4000、4500、6000米。产能：1200卷/天。可按客户要求定制，包括印刷OEM商标、私人标签、特殊尺寸及包装方式。",
