      "techSpecs": "<!--StartFragment--><h2><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">2. Usage:&nbsp;</span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">It is widely used in packaging flowers and other gift things<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">3. Featuring :&nbsp;</span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">Super high transparency and glossy,Super high tensile strength<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">Super high grease barrier, Excellent ink and coating adhesion<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">Low static electricity,Superior thickness uniformity<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">Smoothness of the vertical section and much compact of film rolls winding<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">4. Technology data:&nbsp;</span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">TYPICAL VALUES AND PHYSICAL PROPERTIES&nbsp;<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 27px;\">5. Packing:&nbsp;</span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">&nbsp;use carton and &nbsp;kraft paper and bobble film to packing as inner package, and use pallets and wood board to packing as outer package<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 27px;\">6. Logos: We can printed any logos for buyers.and it was free of charge for logos printed, and buyer need pay to us the private brand logo plate-designs fees.</span></h2><!--EndFragment-->",
