      "descEn": "<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"margin:0 auto;\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"middle\"><h2>BOPP SLEEVES&nbsp;<br>Pre-formed BOPP sleeve bags for single bouquets or potted plants, giving florists a ready-to-use cone or sleeve shape instead of flat roll or sheet film, while keeping the same clarity and stiffness that let the flowers show through.</h2><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--></td>\n  </tr>\n  \n  <tr>\n    <td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"middle\"><h2>Details : </h2></td>\n    </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td colspan=\"2\" class=\"line_buttom_hui_xuxian\"><h2>BOPP Flower Sleeve<br>Usage : Used for packing all kinds of flowers<br> Thickness : 15-50UM (Microns)<br> 's private logos .<br>Style: all kinds of designs and can adopt customer’s appointed designs.<br>Applications’ area : Supporting automatic packaging \nmachine with patch, bag , folding M edge, perforated, the perforation \nroll, cutting and others.<br></h2><div><!--StartFragment--><h2><img border=\"0\" hspace=\"5\" vspace=\"5\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://boppfilmsale.com/pic/other/2013-01-30-23-13-116.jpg\" style=\"width: 195px; height: 241px;\"><img border=\"0\" hspace=\"5\" vspace=\"5\" width=\"283\" height=\"283\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://boppfilmsale.com/pic/other/2013-01-30-23-12-232.jpg\" style=\"width: 256px; height: 241px;\"><img border=\"0\" hspace=\"5\" vspace=\"5\" width=\"540\" height=\"411\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://boppfilmsale.com/pic/other/2013-01-30-23-11-517.jpg\" style=\"width: 282px; height: 246px;\"></h2><!--EndFragment--></div></td></tr></tbody></table><!--EndFragment-->",
