      "descEn": "<h2><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">Super clear and glossy &nbsp;BOPP film (Polypropylene film)<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats';  font-size: 24px; background-\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">with<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats';  font-size: 24px; background-\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">a.) one side corona treatment<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats';  font-size: 24px; background-\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">b.) both side(s) corona treated.<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats';  font-size: 24px; background-\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">A high-gloss, clear BOPP film coated with EVA glue on one side for thermal lamination, giving printed surfaces a bright, glossy protective finish. Supplied in jumbo rolls for slitting to the widths needed by lamination lines.<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\" style=\"line-height: 36px;\"><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">1. Stype:&nbsp;<br></span></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: normal; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\">Specifications<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\" style=\"line-height: 36px;\"><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: normal;\" style=\"line-height: normal;\">Thickness:15,18,20,25,30,35,40 micron Width:350-1600 mm<br></span></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: normal; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\">Length:1000m,2000M,4000m ,6000m ,7000m, 8000m<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: normal; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\">For example:&nbsp;<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: normal; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\">a.)&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>BOPP smaller rolls for gift flower wrapping in clear and color logo printed:&nbsp;<br><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: normal; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\">25Mic*900MM*200M&nbsp;<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\" style=\"line-height: 36px;\">&nbsp;b.)&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>BOPP smaller rolls for packet/box wrapping :&nbsp;<br><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: normal; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\">20Mic*118,120,125,130,135,150,350,380MM*6000M&nbsp;<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: normal; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\">\"line-height: normal; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\" style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\"&gt;Packing: use carton &amp; pallets or as customers requirements<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: normal; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\">Customer's own requirement is available for us such as printed OEM logos and private label or particular size and package style.<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\" style=\"line-height: 36px;\"><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">2. Usage: &nbsp;</span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">It is widely used in packaging industry such as printing, lamination and Aluminium metallization.&nbsp;<br></span></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">3. Featuring :<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">Super high transparency and glossy,Super high tensile strength<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">Super high grease barrier, Excellent ink and coating adhesion<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">Low static electricity,Superior thickness uniformity<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; background-\" style=\"line-height: 24px;\">Smoothness of the vertical section and much compact of film rolls winding</span></h2>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<!--EndFragment--><!--EndFragment-->",
