      "descEn": "<h2>BOPP PEARLIZED FILM(BOPP WHITE OPAQUE FILM)<br>&nbsp;co-extruded, pearlised white-opaque BOPP film produced on a full casting-to-winding production line, heat-sealable on both sides with corona treatment on one side for good print adhesion. Delivers an attractive pearl-white appearance for food, gift and confectionery packaging.<br>Is\n widely used for packaging application’s in surface printing . with both\n sides heat sealable. the film shows the pearlized white opacity \nappearance.<br>Thickness : 18,20,24,25,30,35,40,45 UM (microns)<br>\"font-size: 24px\"&gt;Character: high heat strength ; excellent ultraviolet resistance ; excellent prarlized<br> Appearance ; high separative function<br>Applications: used for food \n,chopsticksand ,gift ,soap package and freeze cold drink such as ice \ncream .thermal label ,sweet food ,biscuit ,snack food. As well can \nlaminating with CPP or PE film.</h2><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment-->\n\n\n\n\n<!--EndFragment-->",
