      "descEn": "<div><font size=\"3\">BOPP macro and micro perforated film </font></div>\n<div>&nbsp;BOPP film with a regular pattern of micro-perforations, allowing controlled air/moisture exchange while retaining the film's strength and clarity. Commonly used for fresh produce, bakery and other packaging that needs ventilation.</div><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment-->\n<div><font size=\"3\">Material items :BOPP/CPP micro perforated film &amp; BOPP/CPP macro perforated film </font></div>\n<div><font size=\"3\">Thickness : 20,25,28,30,35,40,55 micron</font></div>\n<div><font size=\"3\">Width :380MM,450MM,500MM,650MM,800MM,950MM</font></div>\n<div><font size=\"3\">Length : 1400M, 1500M,2000M,3000M,4000M</font></div>\n<div><font size=\"3\">1.</font></div>\n<div><font size=\"3\">FOR micro perforated film</font></div>\n<div><font size=\"3\">Normally , micro perforated 's density is :P160 , this is :160 holes per square inch. </font></div>\n<div><font size=\"3\">TD (Machine Direction):2mm, MD(Transverse Direction):2 mm. </font></div>\n<div><font size=\"3\">2. </font></div>\n<div><font size=\"3\">FOR macro perforated film</font></div>\n<div><font size=\"3\">Macro perforated, also called air hole, usually , diameter of the hole is 1cm, space between holes ( hole pitch) is : 3”(76mm)</font></div>\n<div><font size=\"3\">All the hole diameter would be approx 8mm, distance between whole holes is 4cm.</font></div><!--EndFragment-->",
      "descZh": "带规律微孔的BOPP薄膜，在保持薄膜强度和透明度的同时，能实现可控的透气/透湿，常用于生鲜、烘焙等需要通风的包装场景。",
