      "id": 61,
      "image": "https://484e5af0.telegraph-image-8xr.pages.dev/file/AgACAgUAAyEGAATkLALaAAMJak3CBTHIV5Mc3KGLg7dzteI8j9UAApgRaxttEnBWjnZtlxoz-G4BAAMCAAN4AAM8BA.jpg",
      "price": "From $0.8/m²",
      "specs": [
        "350-1600mm width",
        "Printing/Lamination grade"
      ],
      "descEn": "<p>Plain BOPP Film (Bi-axially Oriented Polypropylene) for printing and lamination. BOPP film is a packing film with superior mechanical properties, transparent and moisture-proof, formed by stretching polypropylene sheet in both the machine and transverse directions.</p><p>Widely used for plain, laminated, matte and metallized film applications such as carton boxes, flowers, gifts, food, confectionery, CD/DVD wrapping, cigarette packs and box packaging, as well as printing, clothing wrap, tape base material and laminating film.</p><ul><li>High transparency and gloss</li><li>High tensile strength</li><li>High grease barrier</li><li>Excellent ink and coating adhesion</li><li>Low static electricity</li><li>Superior thickness uniformity</li><li>Smooth rolling and neat roll ends</li></ul>",
      "descZh": "<p>BOPP双向拉伸聚丙烯薄膜，适用于印刷和复合。BOPP薄膜具有优异的机械性能，透明且防潮，通过将聚丙烯薄片沿纵向和横向双向拉伸而成。</p><p>广泛用于平膜、复合膜、哑光及镀铝膜等多种用途，如纸箱、鲜花、礼品、食品、糖果、CD/DVD包装、香烟包装及箱装包装，也可用于印刷、服装包装、胶带基材及层压薄膜。</p><ul><li>高透明度和光泽度</li><li>高抗拉强度</li><li>优异的隔油性</li><li>优异的油墨和涂层附着力</li><li>低静电</li><li>厚度均匀性优异</li><li>卷绕平滑，卷边整齐</li></ul>",
      "nameEn": "Bopp Plain Film",
      "nameZh": "Bopp普通薄膜",
      "status": "active",
      "category": "boppfilm-printing",
      "keywords": [],
      "techSpecs": "<table><tbody><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th></tr><tr><td>Thickness</td><td>10, 12, 15, 18µm (lamination); 20, 23, 25, 28, 30, 35-52µm (printing); 23, 25, 28µm (tape base); 35, 37, 40, 50µm (bag film)</td></tr><tr><td>Width</td><td>350mm - 1600mm</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>2000m / 3000m / 4000m / 7000m / 8000m / 9000m</td></tr><tr><td>Corona treated side</td><td>Single (one) side or double (two) sides</td></tr><tr><td>Heat sealable</td><td>Non-heat sealable</td></tr><tr><td>Application</td><td>Printing, lamination, aluminium metallization</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Transparent, clear</td></tr><tr><td>Inner core</td><td>76mm (3\") / 152mm (6\")</td></tr><tr><td>Package method</td><td>Carton with bubble film around rolls, on wooden or plastic pallets</td></tr></tbody></table>",
