      "descEn": "<!--StartFragment--><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\" style=\"line-height: 36px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\">BOPP white opaque film (BOPP pearlized film)&nbsp;</span><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 36px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\" style=\"line-height: 36px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\">&nbsp;<br><p>Bopp Polypropylene film white opaque pearlized film</p></span><p style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\" style=\"line-height: 36px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\">Pearl\n film&nbsp;in the actual&nbsp;selection process,&nbsp;a \nparticulate&nbsp;CaCO3&nbsp;masterbatch&nbsp;uniformly dispersed in the&nbsp;homopolymer \nPP&nbsp;to form&nbsp;many holes&nbsp;when the&nbsp;PP&nbsp;stretching, it is these&nbsp;holes&nbsp;refract \nlight&nbsp;to form a&nbsp;pearl effect.&nbsp;BOPP&nbsp;film&nbsp;has a&nbsp;white \npearl&nbsp;pearl&nbsp;color,&nbsp;can reflect&nbsp;more&nbsp;light, and its&nbsp;gas barrier \nproperties,&nbsp;water blocking&nbsp;BOPP film&nbsp;than&nbsp;other varieties&nbsp;of&nbsp;fine.<br>\nPearl&nbsp;BOPP&nbsp;film applications<br>\nThickness of&nbsp;35μm-sided&nbsp;sealing&nbsp;type&nbsp;BOPP&nbsp;pearl film&nbsp;can be directly \nused&nbsp;ice cream, ice cream&nbsp;and other cold drinks&nbsp;packaging, can also&nbsp;be \nused for&nbsp;candy&nbsp;pillow packing, chocolate, soap&nbsp;protective&nbsp;packaging.&nbsp;The\n thickness&nbsp;of&nbsp;the double-sided&nbsp;sealing BOPP&nbsp;pearl film&nbsp;30μm&nbsp;widely used \nin&nbsp;biscuits,&nbsp;sweets, candy,&nbsp;snacks&nbsp;and other packaging.</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\" style=\"line-height: 36px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\">Principle&nbsp;pearl&nbsp;BOPP film<br>\nPearl film&nbsp;is&nbsp;incorporated&nbsp;pearlescent pigment&nbsp;in the \nplastic&nbsp;particles&nbsp;produced&nbsp;out of a&nbsp;two-way stretch&nbsp;after&nbsp;heat \nsetting&nbsp;BOPP film.&nbsp;A typical&nbsp;use of&nbsp;BOPP&nbsp;film is a&nbsp;pearl&nbsp;pearl film&nbsp;A / B\n / A3&nbsp;layer&nbsp;co-extruded biaxially&nbsp;stretching method&nbsp;of production,&nbsp;in \nwhich&nbsp;B&nbsp;is a&nbsp;pearlescent&nbsp;blended&nbsp;masterbatch&nbsp;polypropylene, A&nbsp;is a&nbsp;pearl\n film&nbsp;with&nbsp;surface properties&nbsp;vary&nbsp;the&nbsp;PP&nbsp;copolymer,&nbsp;having&nbsp;good&nbsp;heat \nsealability.&nbsp;Biaxially stretched&nbsp;at&nbsp;below the melting point&nbsp;the \nmaterial&nbsp;B, A&nbsp;be&nbsp;the material&nbsp;above the melting point.<br>\nSince B&nbsp;inorganic&nbsp;compound&nbsp;containing more&nbsp;pearlescent&nbsp;pigment \nparticles, the result&nbsp;is a&nbsp;two-way stretch: \nPolypropylene&nbsp;molecules&nbsp;were&nbsp;oriented&nbsp;along&nbsp;the direction of&nbsp;the \nexternal force,&nbsp;and the distance&nbsp;between&nbsp;the pearlescent \npigment&nbsp;granule&nbsp;pulled a large,&nbsp;void formation,&nbsp;the \nB-layer&nbsp;into&nbsp;a&nbsp;mechanical foaming&nbsp;foams.&nbsp;Therefore, pearl film&nbsp;A / B / \nA&nbsp;structure&nbsp;is a&nbsp;two-way stretch&nbsp;foam&nbsp;BOPP&nbsp;film,&nbsp;BOPP film&nbsp;than the \naverage&nbsp;proportion of&nbsp;small,&nbsp;only 0.7&nbsp;to 0.75,&nbsp;while&nbsp;the \naverage&nbsp;proportion of&nbsp;BOPP film&nbsp;is about&nbsp;0.9.<br>\nA&nbsp;material&nbsp;layer&nbsp;pearl&nbsp;BOPP&nbsp;film&nbsp;has the effect of&nbsp;protecting&nbsp;B \nmaterial&nbsp;layer,&nbsp;and gives&nbsp;the film&nbsp;a certain degree of&nbsp;heat \nsealing&nbsp;pearl, so&nbsp;pearl film&nbsp;A / B / A&nbsp;sealing&nbsp;structure&nbsp;is \ngood.&nbsp;And&nbsp;only&nbsp;B&nbsp;material&nbsp;produced&nbsp;pearl film,&nbsp;the film&nbsp;can only rely \non&nbsp;porosity&nbsp;and small amounts of&nbsp;non-oriented&nbsp;PP&nbsp;molecules&nbsp;slight&nbsp;heat \nsealing,&nbsp;heat sealing&nbsp;the film&nbsp;after&nbsp;pearl&nbsp;tear&nbsp;easily&nbsp;be&nbsp;peeled off.<br>\nPearl&nbsp;BOPP&nbsp;film&nbsp;performance parameters</span></p><!--EndFragment-->",
