      "descEn": "<h2>BOPP Capacitor Film (clear film)<br>Features:<br>With one side is corona \ntreatment and the reverse side is clear smooth .It homogenizes in \nthickness , low dielectric loss, high electric strength ,excellent \nprocession . single side corona treated for the Zn or Zn/Al metallized.<br>Specialized clear BOPP film for film-capacitor manufacturing, available as single-side rough (R-PP) or double-side rough (RR-PP) surface for power capacitor applications. Corona-treated on one side for good metallizing adhesion, it offers high dielectric strength, low dielectric loss and stable thickness for reliable electrical performance.<br>Mainly used for dielectric \nmaterials for the low-voltage and parallel power capacitor, capacitor \nfor alternating current motor and direct current capacitor.<br>Specification:<br>&nbsp;BOPP capacitor film have two items :<br> \n1. BOPP clear capacitor film<br> \n1.)M-PP for metallized -film capacitors applications .<br> \n2.)S-PP for foil-film capacitors applications .<br> \nThe standard thickness range including: 3 ,4,5,6,7,8,9,10,12 microns .<br>\nThe standard tolerance thickness: +/-0.2 Um .<br>\nThe width range including: can slit any width(MM )upon the requirement.<br> \nThe inner core : 3\" (76MM)<br>\nThe outer core: 150-350 MM .<br>\n2. BOPP rough clear capacitor film .<br>\n1.)R-PP : one side of rough capacitor film ( power capacitor use).<br> \n2.)RR-PP: two sides of rough capacitor film .&nbsp;<br> \nThe thickness range including: 6,7,8,9,10,12,18 microns .<br>\nThe width range including: can slit any width(MM) upon the requirement.<br> \nThe inner core : 3\" (76MM),6'(152MM)<br>\nThe outer core: 150-350 MM.</h2>\n\n\n\n\n<!--EndFragment-->",
      "descZh": "专为薄膜电容器制造设计的透明BOPP电容器膜，分为单面粗化（R-PP，适用于电力电容器）和双面粗化（RR-PP）两种规格。单面电晕处理，有利于金属化附着，具有高介电强度、低介电损耗和稳定的厚度公差，确保电气性能可靠。",
      "nameEn": "BOPP Capacitor Film (clear film)",
