      "descEn": "<!--StartFragment--><h3><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma;\">4.5 Microns BOPET Film silver metallized</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma;\">&nbsp;4.5\n Microns BOPET Film silver metallized, Bopet polyester metallized film \nhas a super reflective, mirror- like surface. It is a oriented polyester\n film with a very</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma;\">thin coating of aluminum that is vacuum deposited on to the surface of the film. This film is used in a variety of</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma;\">industrial and applications, including printing, packaging, crafts and many other applications.&nbsp;</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma;\">Main features of bopet polyester metallized film</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma;\">a. Good Metal Bond Strength</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma;\">b. Good Barrier properties of oxygen, light, water vapor</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma;\">c. Good Lamination Bond Strength</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma;\">d. Excellent Machinability</span></span></h3><!--EndFragment-->",
