      "descEn": "<h2>Color VMPET film<br>A coloured, metallized PET film (Color VMPET) with high aluminium-layer adhesion, good brightness and colour uniformity, plus strong ink adsorption and mechanical properties. Used for cigarette cases, Christmas garlands, wine compound-packaging and gift wrapping.&nbsp;<br>\n1. High adhesion of Aluminizing layer, good brightness<br>\n2. Good color uniformity, good layer adhesion for color fastness.<br>\n3. Good adsorption properties of ink.<br>\n4. Excellent mechanical properties<br>\n5. Used in the cigarette case, Christmas garlands ,compound packing of \nwine and some gift packaging, can also be used for outdoor first aid</h2><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment-->",
