      "descEn": "<div><h2>BOPET PLAIN FILM&nbsp;<br>BOPET film (biaxially oriented \nPolyester films) featurines good thermal stability and tenacity; low air\n and water permeability; applicable to vacuum aluminum plating, compound\n package, cooking bag manufacture, etc.&nbsp;<br>Biaxially-oriented polyester (BOPET) plain film with good thermal stability, tenacity and low air/water permeability, suitable for vacuum aluminium plating, composite packaging and cooking-bag manufacture. Good ink and coating adhesion supports multi-colour printing, and it's commonly used for heat-sealed bags in frozen food, industrial goods and cosmetics packaging.<br>\nFeaturing :&nbsp;<br>Having the good adhesion with ink and \ncoating, can be used for multi-color printings with good flatness. Is \nmainly used in heat-sealing bags of frozen food, industrial products and\n cosmetics packaging.<br> \nSpecification:<br>\nthickness: 12 microns-25 microns, 75 microns-150 microns ,185 microns-380 microns, 500 microns<br>\nwidth :200-1200MM&nbsp;<br> \nlength : 500m ,1000m ,1500m,4000m,6000m,9000m,12000m<br>\nPolyester film is wound around paper shaft with an internal diameter of \n76.2mm-152.4mm and covered with polyethylene film; each coil is \nsupported by damper and put in carton; medium and large package needs \nwooden mount.<br>\nCustomer's own requirement is available for us such as printed OEM logos and private label or particular size and package style.</h2>\n<!--StartFragment-->\n<strong>\n<br>\n</strong></div><strong>\n</strong>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<span style=\"font-family: Tahoma;\"><strong>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n</strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>\n<div align=\"center\"><br></div></strong></span></span><!--EndFragment-->",
      "descZh": "双向拉伸聚酯（BOPET）普通膜，热稳定性好、韧性强、气密及水密性佳，适用于真空镀铝、复合包装及蒸煮袋制造。油墨及涂层附着力好，支持多色印刷，常用于速冻食品、工业品及化妆品包装的热封袋。",
