      "descEn": "<span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Acrylic acid coating film</span>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">1. ACRYLIC ACID COATING BOPP FILM<br>\nAcrylic coated BOPP film on one or two side(s) with a detailed description of:<br>\nBOPP acrylic films were based on BOPP film, coated on one or two side(s) with acrylic. Wide range of&nbsp;<br>\nuses, especially suitable for the packaging of biscuits and other snack products ; suitable for food boxes,&nbsp;<br>\nmedicine boxes, perfume boxes, cosmetic boxes.&nbsp;<br>\nMain performance for Crylic acid coating film:<br>\na.) excellent packaging adaptability, low coefficient of friction of the coating and stability;&nbsp;<br>\nb.) excellent low-temperature heat sealing properties, outstanding transparency properties;&nbsp;<br>\nc.) applicable to various ink printing, including water-based inks<br>\nThickness: 20 30 Microns...<br>\nWidth: 120-1500MM Length: 200-4000M Inner core:1\" 2\" 3\" 6\".&nbsp;<br>\n2. ACRYLIC ACID COATING BOPET FILM<br>\nAcrylic coated BOPET film on one or two side(s) with a detailed description of:<br>\nThe film is PET acrylic coating film to the substrate, the single-sided coating of acrylic. Particularly&nbsp;<br>\nsuitable for the packaging of biscuits and other snack products Bao-Xiang; also suitable for food boxes,&nbsp;<br>\nmedicine boxes, perfume boxes, cosmetic boxes.&nbsp;<br>\nMain performance for Acrylic acid coating film<br>\na.) excellent packaging adaptability, low coefficient of friction of the coating and stability;&nbsp;<br>\nb.) excellent low-temperature heat sealing properties, outstanding transparency properties;&nbsp;<br>\nc.) applicable to various ink printing, including water-based inks.<br>\nThickness: 14.1 17.1 Microns...<br>\nWidth: 120-1500MM Length: 200-4000M Inner core:1\" 2\" 3\" 6\".</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"></p><p style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 16px;\">2. Usage</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 16px;\">It is widely used in packaging industry such as printing, lamination and Aluminium metallization.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 16px;\">And packing: bread,</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 16px;\">3. Featuring :</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 16px;\">Super high transparency and glossy,Super high tensile strength</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 16px;\">Super high grease barrier, Excellent ink and coating adhesion</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 16px;\">Low static electricity,Superior thickness uniformity</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 16px;\">Smoothness of the vertical section and much compact of film rolls winding</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, &quot;zapf dingbats&quot;; font-size: 16px;\">Packing: use kraft paper and bobble film to packing as inner package, and use pallets and wood board to packing as outer package</span></p><!--EndFragment-->",
      "descZh": "丙烯酸涂层BOPP及BOPET薄膜，单面或双面涂布丙烯酸树脂。广泛用于饼干及其他休闲食品包装，同时适用于食品盒、药盒、香水盒、化妆品盒等包装。主要性能：优异的包装适应性，摩擦系数低且稳定；优异的低温热封性能，透明度出色；可适用于各类油墨印刷，包括水性油墨。丙烯酸涂层BOPP膜厚度：20、30微米；丙烯酸涂层BOPET膜厚度：14.1、17.1微米。幅宽120-1500毫米，长度200-4000米，纸芯规格1\"/2\"/3\"/6\"。",
