      "descEn": "KPE is PE film coated on both sides with a heat-sealing PVDC barrier coating, part of the PVDC coating film (K-film) family alongside KOPP (BOPP-based), KPA (BOPA-based) and KPET (BOPET-based). Features excellent gas barrier and fragrance-preservation properties, excellent low-temperature heat-sealing with good sealing/smoothing performance, and very good transparency. Main uses: cigarette packaging, snack packaging, dessert packaging. Width 120-1500mm, length 200-4000m, inner core 1\"/2\"/3\"/6\".",
      "descZh": "KPE是在PE薄膜两面涂布PVDC热封阻隔涂层的产品，与KOPP（BOPP基）、KPA（BOPA基）、KPET（BOPET基）同属PVDC涂布K膜系列。具有优异的气体阻隔性和保香性能，优异的低温热封性能，封合平滑效果好，透明度非常好。主要用途：香烟包装、休闲食品包装、甜品包装。幅宽120-1500毫米，长度200-4000米，纸芯规格1\"/2\"/3\"/6\"。",
