      "descEn": "<h2><span style=\"line-height: 36px;\">PVDC coating film -K film (BOPP/BOPA/BOPET film coated PVDC)<br></span>&nbsp;PVDC coating film - K film (BOPP/BOPA/BOPET/PE film coated with PVDC), available as KOPP (BOPP base), KPA (BOPA base), KPET (BOPET base) and KPE (PE base), coated on both sides with a heat-sealing barrier PVDC coating. Thickness: 12μm for KPET, 21μm for KOPP, 17μm for KPA. Width 120-1500mm, length 200-4000m, inner core 1\"/2\"/3\"/6\". Features: excellent gas barrier and fragrance-preservation properties; excellent low-temperature heat-sealing with good sealing/smoothing performance; very good transparency. Main uses: cigarette packaging, snack packaging, dessert packaging. Representative tech spec: 19μm matte BOPP base (white or black) + one-side PVDC coat (2-2.5μm, 3.5g/m²) = 23-24μm total (K-BOPP-Matte, 130mm width spec); 15μm PET base (white or black, gloss) + one-side PVDC coat = 20-21μm total (K-PET gloss, 156mm width spec); 19μm BOPP base (white or black, gloss) + one-side PVDC coat = 23-24μm total (K-BOPP gloss, 130mm width spec).<br><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; \" style=\"line-height: 36px;\">1 Types for PVDC coating film -K film<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; \" style=\"line-height: 36px;\">PVDC coating film -K film (BOPP/BOPA/BOPET film coated PVDC)<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; \" style=\"line-height: 36px;\">KOPP (BOPP film, coated on both sides heat sealing barrier PVDC coating)</span><img src=\"http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1rstSFVXXXXaPXpXXq6xXFXXXV/221290553/HTB1rstSFVXXXXaPXpXXq6xXFXXXV.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20140701_092507.jpg\" ori-width=\"600\" ori-height=\"600\" data-mce-src=\"http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1rstSFVXXXXaPXpXXq6xXFXXXV/221290553/HTB1rstSFVXXXXaPXpXXq6xXFXXXV.jpg\" style=\"border: 0px; cursor: default;\"><img src=\"http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1OiFRFVXXXXb2XpXXq6xXFXXXK/221290553/HTB1OiFRFVXXXXb2XpXXq6xXFXXXK.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20140701_092617.jpg\" ori-width=\"600\" ori-height=\"600\" data-mce-src=\"http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1OiFRFVXXXXb2XpXXq6xXFXXXK/221290553/HTB1OiFRFVXXXXb2XpXXq6xXFXXXK.jpg\" style=\"border: 0px; cursor: default;\"><img src=\"http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1IgVQFVXXXXcAXFXXq6xXFXXXv/221290553/HTB1IgVQFVXXXXcAXFXXq6xXFXXXv.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20140701_093529.jpg\" ori-width=\"600\" ori-height=\"600\" data-mce-src=\"http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1IgVQFVXXXXcAXFXXq6xXFXXXv/221290553/HTB1IgVQFVXXXXcAXFXXq6xXFXXXv.jpg\" style=\"border: 0px; cursor: default;\"><img src=\"http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1zQNUFVXXXXXJXXXXq6xXFXXX5/221290553/HTB1zQNUFVXXXXXJXXXXq6xXFXXX5.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20140701_093730.jpg\" ori-width=\"600\" ori-height=\"600\" data-mce-src=\"http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1zQNUFVXXXXXJXXXXq6xXFXXX5/221290553/HTB1zQNUFVXXXXXJXXXXq6xXFXXX5.jpg\" style=\"border: 0px; cursor: default;\"><img src=\"http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1LuJPFVXXXXbbXVXXq6xXFXXXI/221290553/HTB1LuJPFVXXXXbbXVXXq6xXFXXXI.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20140701_102814.jpg\" ori-width=\"600\" ori-height=\"600\" data-mce-src=\"http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1LuJPFVXXXXbbXVXXq6xXFXXXI/221290553/HTB1LuJPFVXXXXbbXVXXq6xXFXXXI.jpg\" style=\"border: 0px; cursor: default;\"><br><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; \" style=\"line-height: 36px;\">KPA (BOPA film, coated on both sides heat sealing barrier PVDC coating)<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; \" style=\"line-height: 36px;\">KPET (BOPET film, coated on both sides heat sealing barrier PVDC coating)</span><img src=\"http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1Sw4TFVXXXXc8XXXXq6xXFXXXz/221290553/HTB1Sw4TFVXXXXc8XXXXq6xXFXXXz.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20140701_103637.jpg\" ori-width=\"600\" ori-height=\"600\" data-mce-src=\"http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1Sw4TFVXXXXc8XXXXq6xXFXXXz/221290553/HTB1Sw4TFVXXXXc8XXXXq6xXFXXXz.jpg\" style=\"border: 0px; cursor: default;\"><img src=\"http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB12WFVFVXXXXXDXXXXq6xXFXXXN/221290553/HTB12WFVFVXXXXXDXXXXq6xXFXXXN.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20140701_103821.jpg\" ori-width=\"600\" ori-height=\"600\" data-mce-src=\"http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB12WFVFVXXXXXDXXXXq6xXFXXXN/221290553/HTB12WFVFVXXXXXDXXXXq6xXFXXXN.jpg\" style=\"border: 0px; cursor: default;\"><img src=\"http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1cipSFVXXXXa2XpXXq6xXFXXXK/221290553/HTB1cipSFVXXXXa2XpXXq6xXFXXXK.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20140701_103829.jpg\" ori-width=\"600\" ori-height=\"600\" data-mce-src=\"http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1cipSFVXXXXa2XpXXq6xXFXXXK/221290553/HTB1cipSFVXXXXa2XpXXq6xXFXXXK.jpg\" style=\"border: 0px; cursor: default;\"><br><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; \" style=\"line-height: 36px;\">KPE (PE film, coated on both sides heat sealing barrier PVDC coating)<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; \" style=\"line-height: 36px;\">Thickness of PVDC coating film: 12UM (for KPET),21UM (for KOPP),17UM (for KPA)...<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; \" style=\"line-height: 36px;\">Width of PVDC coating film: 120-1500MM Length: 200-4000M Inner core:1\" 2\" 3\" 6\".&nbsp;<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; \" style=\"line-height: 36px;\">2 Features of PVDC coating film -K film (BOPP/BOPA/BOPET film coated PVDC)<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; \" style=\"line-height: 36px;\">a. excellent gas barrier properties, excellent in fragrance preservation property<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; \" style=\"line-height: 36px;\">b. excellent low-temperature heat-sealing properties, sealing and smoothing seed<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; \" style=\"line-height: 36px;\">very good transparent performance<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; \" style=\"line-height: 36px;\">3 main purposes for PVDC coating film -K film (BOPP/BOPA/BOPET film coated PVDC):<br></span><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px; \" style=\"line-height: 36px;\">a. cigarette packaging b snack packaging c. dessert packaging</span></h2><!--StartFragment--><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment-->\n<!--EndFragment-->",
      "descZh": "PVDC涂布K膜（BOPP/BOPA/BOPET/PE基材涂布PVDC），包括KOPP（BOPP基）、KPA（BOPA基）、KPET（BOPET基）、KPE（PE基）四种，双面涂布热封阻隔用PVDC涂层。厚度：KPET为12微米，KOPP为21微米，KPA为17微米。幅宽120-1500毫米，长度200-4000米，纸芯规格1\"/2\"/3\"/6\"。特点：优异的气体阻隔性和保香性能；优异的低温热封性能，封合平滑效果好；透明度非常好。主要用途：香烟包装、休闲食品包装、甜品包装。典型技术参数示例：19微米亚光BOPP基材（白色或黑色）+单面PVDC涂层（2-2.5微米，3.5克/平方米）=总厚度23-24微米（K-BOPP-Matte，130毫米幅宽规格）；15微米PET基材（白色或黑色，光面）+单面PVDC涂层=总厚度20-21微米（K-PET gloss，156毫米幅宽规格）；19微米BOPP基材（白色或黑色，光面）+单面PVDC涂层=总厚度23-24微米（K-BOPP gloss，130毫米幅宽规格）。",
