      "descEn": "<p style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px; \" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px; \">Double sides adhesive tape jumbo rolls<br><!--StartFragment--><span style=\"font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Double sides adhesive tape jumbo rolls (hot melt double-sided tape). Structure: Release layer - release paper; A-surface adhesive - hot melt adhesive; Substrate - tissue paper; B-surface adhesive - hot melt adhesive. Supplied in jumbo roll form for further slitting/converting into finished double-sided tape products for bonding and mounting applications.</span><!--EndFragment--></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">Product Name: hot melt double-sided tape</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">Double sides adhesive tape jumbo rolls consists of:</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">Release: release paper</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">A surface adhesive: hot melt adhesive</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">Substrate: tissue paper</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">B surface adhesive: hot melt adhesive</span></p><p style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px;\" style=\"line-height: 27px; font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span data-mce-style=\"text-decoration: underline;\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span data-mce-style=\" text-decoration: underline;\">Physical properties:</span></span></strong></span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">Total thickness: PET basic:30,80,90,100,120UM,150UM,190UM ....</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">Tissue basic: 60,100,80,160 UM...</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">initial tack&gt; 8</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">180 degree peel force (the stainless steel plate)&gt; 1.1kg/25mm</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">holding force of&gt; 10hrs</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">tensile strength&gt; 7N/cm</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">The above data is based on</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">BOPP packing tape finished rolls , masking tape and double sides adhesive tape finished rolls ,smaller rolls</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">GB4852-84, GB-2792-81, GB-7753-84 test method to detect reliable test results</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">But\n does not represent the guaranteed value of the product, due to \nenvironmental changes, the test results may vary, the numerical \ndeviation 5%, mass production and the use of bigger and then Try \nqualified.</span></p><p style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">\n<strong><span data-mce-style=\"text-decoration: underline;\" style=\"line-height: 18px; text-decoration: underline;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;  text-decoration: underline;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px; \">Characteristics and Uses:</span></span></strong><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">Senior\n white tissue paper substrate, solvent-based polyacrylate adhesive \ncoated both sides covered, then covered with easy to peel the timber is \nmade of;</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">Good\n initial tack and adhesion good, and easy to use cold resistance, good \nheat resistance; the plastic surface equatorial good; apply to leather, \ngift wrap and footwear adhesive stickers, stationery, office.</span></p><p style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;\">Customer's\n own requirement is available for us. Such as : buyer's own printed OEM \nlogos,private label,particular size and private package styles.</span></p><!--EndFragment-->",
