      "descEn": "<font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span>BOPP ADHESIVE TAPE (MINI-ROLL)<p>BOPP adhesive tape supplied as smaller finished rolls (slit down from jumbo rolls) for retail, office and everyday carton-sealing use. Same base construction as standard BOPP packing tape (BOPP film + acrylic/solvent/rubber adhesive). Thickness 35-68 microns; standard small-roll widths (e.g. 48mm) cut to common lengths for hand dispensers; colors clear, tan, brown and printed logo options available.\n</p><p>Adhesion - Acrylic solvent type\n</p><p>\n</p><p>Colors : clear, tan, brown ,red, yellow, beige, white, green, etc.\n</p><p>\n</p><p>Basic material : BOPP (OPP) film</p><p>\n</p><p>Standard size of hand roll: width : 45~50mm, length : 30~50M.\n</p><p>\n</p><p>Standard size of auto machine roll: width : 45~50mm, length : 915-200M.\n</p><p></p><!--EndFragment--><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br></font></div>",
