      "descEn": "<h2><!--StartFragment-->printed tear hair tape self adhesive tear strip<div>Self adhesive tear tapes (tear strips) printed the buyer's nominated logos are used for opening of \ncigarette packs, biscuit bag/boxes, chewing gum bags, medicine pieces, \ngarments, CD, and so forth.</div>\n<div>Tear tapes included BOPP tear tape,BOPET tear tape,adhesive tear \ntape ,cigarette tear tape,BOPET tear tape and other non cigarette usage \ntear tapes</div>\n<div>1) Material of Self adhesive tear tape: BOPET, BOPP,VMOPP,VMOPP.&nbsp;</div>\n<div>2) Width of tear tape rolls: 1.2 - 8.0mm ( such as:1.6mm,1.8mm,2.0mm,2.5mm,3.0mm,4.5mm,6.0mm,8.0mm..)</div>\n<div>3) Run length of tear tape rolls: 5,000 - 50,000m/spool</div>\n<div>4) Color of tear tape rolls: red, gold, silver, green, blue, yellow, transparent, and so forth.</div>\n<div>5) Inner packing for of tear tape rolls: using cartons. Outer packing:using pallets.</div>\n<div>4.) others: anti-counterfeiting tear tape,lightness beam laser \nlabels,water-transfer boardpaper,super crystal brightness cigarette \ntipping paper</div><!--EndFragment--></h2>",
      "descZh": "<h2>BOPP/BOPET自粘撕拉带</h2>\n<p>AEC GROUP供应专业撕拉带（撕裂带）产品，广泛用于烟盒、饼干盒、口香糖袋、药品、服装、CD等包装的开启。材质：BOPP、BOPET、VMOPP。</p>\n<h3>产品类型</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>普通撕拉带</strong> — 广泛用于烟草、扑克牌、药品及影音产品包装。透明、印色或印刷logo。制版经济实惠，文字/logo清晰，具有良好的持粘强度和剥离强度，放卷流畅。</li>\n<li><strong>收缩撕拉带</strong> — 适用于烟草硬包、扑克、药品及影音包装。具有收缩特性，使包装更整洁规范，提升产品品质。</li>\n<li><strong>防伪（全息）撕拉带</strong> — 适用于高档香烟、扑克及药品包装。由原膜模压制成三维激光效果，具有防伪功能，是烟盒高端包装的首选。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>技术规格</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr><th>参数</th><th>规格</th></tr>\n<tr><td>材质</td><td>BOPP / BOPET / VMOPP</td></tr>\n<tr><td>厚度</td><td>25–40 µm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>宽度</td><td>1.2 mm – 8.5 mm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>卷长</td><td>5,000 m – 120,000 m/卷</td></tr>\n<tr><td>内芯</td><td>1寸 / 3寸 / 6寸</td></tr>\n<tr><td>认证</td><td>ISO 9001, ISO 14001, OHSMS 18000</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>颜色与印刷选项</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>透明、金色、银色、红色、黄色、白色、黑色及全彩</li>\n<li>油墨印刷logo、激光/全息效果、定制品牌/语言印刷</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>应用领域</h3>\n<p>烟草、食品包装、茶叶、保健食品、药品、文具、影音产品、扑克、蚊香圈、防伪封签、快递信封撕拉线、香水盒、化妆品盒、安全套盒等。</p>",
