      "descEn": "POF (Polyolefin) Thermal Heat Shrinkable Cling Film&nbsp;<br><!--StartFragment--><div><span style=\" font-size: 12pt\">POF Thermal(heat)Shrinkable Cling Film</span></div>\n<div><span style=\" font-size: 12pt\">Types: </span></div>\n<div><span style=\" font-size: 12pt\">1.)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\">&nbsp;POF cling shink&nbsp;film -Center Folded (such as: 19mic x 45cm x 1000Mtr,30 mic x 585 mm x 1500 m)<br>\n2.)&nbsp; POF cling shink&nbsp;film - Tubular Form (such as:&nbsp;25 mic x&nbsp;330 mm x 1000 m)</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\">3.)</span><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12pt\">POF macro perforated cling film </span></font></div>\n<div align=\"left\"><span style=\" font-size: 12pt\">Thickness :12-25 microns</span></div>\n<div><span style=\" font-size: 12pt\">Five layers of \nco-extruded polyolefin stretch POF thermal(heat) shrinkable film, \nbreaking the traditional three-layers co-extruded film and the \ntraditional of hot-stretching process, featuring a higher toughness and \nhigher anti-impact strength in the line of packaging film industry, and \nit is the most advanced environmentally-friendly plastic packaging \nmaterial. <br>\nMain features:<br>\nHigh-resolution, glossy transparent, protection, and to prevent products\n subject to affecting of dust, moisture and odor without the appearance \nof erosion. <br>\nNice higher anti-crack-toughness and high anti-impact strength, keeping \nthe relatively stable under high temperature and low temperatures, will \nnot be broken, melted, broken ,decomposition and so on, suit for \nlong-distance transportation and packaging of frozen products. <br>\nfaster and higher Shrinking rate, applicable to the packaging of various\n shapes and sizes of products, strong toughness, light weight, thickness\n uniformity, and economy. <br>\nPOF Thermal(heat)shrinkable film used for the beverage, food, medicine, packaging and other chemicals. <br>\nMain products: single-layer membrane, folded membrane, small roll specifications,&nbsp;</span></div><!--EndFragment-->",
      "descZh": "POF（聚烯烃）热收缩缠绕膜——五层共挤环保包装膜。\n\n可供规格：\n• POF收缩膜 – 中折型（如：19微米×45cm×1000m；30微米×585mm×1500m）\n• POF收缩膜 – 管状型（如：25微米×330mm×1000m）\n• POF打孔收缩膜\n\n厚度：12–25微米\n\n主要特点：\n• 高透明度、光泽外观，有效防止灰尘、湿气和异味侵入\n• 优异的抗裂韧性和抗冲击强度，高低温下性能稳定，适合冷冻品长途运输\n• 快速高效的收缩率，适用于各种形状和尺寸的产品包装\n• 轻量化、厚度均匀、经济实惠\n\n用途：饮料、食品、医药、化工品包装",
