      "descEn": "<h2><!--StartFragment--></h2><h2>BOPP TEAR TAPE<br>\n1. General tear tape<br> \n----Is widely used in cigarettes, playing cards, pharmaceutical, \naudio-visual products,such as film packaging products, decoration's \npackaging and opening,<br> \nStype: transparent tear tape, tear tape line , color logo printed tear tape and other forms.<br> \nFeatures:plate-making process is affordable, text/logo clear, has a good hold and peel adhesive strength, smooth unwinding.<br>2. Shrinkage tear tape<br>\n----Is widely used in cigarettes (hard pack), poker, drugs, audio-visual\n products such as film packaging products, decoration's packaging and \nopening,<br>\nFeatures: with shrinkage characteristic, and make the package more \norderly, rules. Improving product quality, has good adhesion and peel \nstrength holding, smooth unwinding.<br>\n3. Anti-counterfeiting tear tape<br> \n----Is&nbsp; widely used in high-grade cigarette, poker, drugs, film \npackaging products .Such as audio and video products decorated and \nopened in packaging.<br>\nFeatures: molded by the original film,&nbsp; made the text/logo into \nthree-dimensional laser effects, has some anti-counterfeiting features, \nat present , it is the first choice in cigarette packs and its high-end \nproducts.<br>\n4. Nromal sizes :&nbsp;<br>\nTear tape( tear strip) are used for opening cigarette packs, biscuit \nbag/boxes, chewing gum bags, medicine pieces, garments , CD, and so \nforth.<br>\nFeatures:<br>\n1) Material:&nbsp; BOPP&nbsp;( or BOPET ,VMOPP ,VMOPP)&nbsp;<br>\n2) Width: 1.2 - 3.0mm<br>\n3) Run length: 5,000 - 50,000m/spool<br>\n4)&nbsp;AEC GROUP supplies professional tear tape (tear strip) lines used for the opening of cigarette packs, biscuit boxes, chewing gum bags, medicine pieces, garments, CDs, and other packed goods. Materials: BOPP, BOPET, VMOPP.<br>Types<ul><li>General Tear Tape — Widely used in cigarettes, playing cards, pharmaceutical and audio-visual packaging. Transparent, colour-printed or logo-printed. Affordable plate-making, clear text/logo, excellent adhesion and peel strength, smooth unwinding.</li></ul><ul><li>Shrinkage Tear Tape — For cigarette hard-pack, poker, drugs and audio-visual packaging. Shrinkage characteristic keeps packaging neat and orderly; good adhesion, smooth unwinding.</li></ul><ul><li>Anti-Counterfeiting (Holographic) Tear Tape — For premium cigarettes, poker and pharmaceutical packaging. Three-dimensional laser effects moulded into the film; first choice for high-end cigarette packs.</li></ul></h2>",
      "descZh": "<h2>BOPP/BOPET自粘撕拉带</h2>\n<p>AEC GROUP供应专业撕拉带（撕裂带）产品，广泛用于烟盒、饼干盒、口香糖袋、药品、服装、CD等包装的开启。材质：BOPP、BOPET、VMOPP。</p>\n<h3>产品类型</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>普通撕拉带</strong> — 广泛用于烟草、扑克牌、药品及影音产品包装。透明、印色或印刷logo。制版经济实惠，文字/logo清晰，具有良好的持粘强度和剥离强度，放卷流畅。</li>\n<li><strong>收缩撕拉带</strong> — 适用于烟草硬包、扑克、药品及影音包装。具有收缩特性，使包装更整洁规范，提升产品品质。</li>\n<li><strong>防伪（全息）撕拉带</strong> — 适用于高档香烟、扑克及药品包装。由原膜模压制成三维激光效果，具有防伪功能，是烟盒高端包装的首选。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>技术规格</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr><th>参数</th><th>规格</th></tr>\n<tr><td>材质</td><td>BOPP / BOPET / VMOPP</td></tr>\n<tr><td>厚度</td><td>25–40 µm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>宽度</td><td>1.2 mm – 8.5 mm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>卷长</td><td>5,000 m – 120,000 m/卷</td></tr>\n<tr><td>内芯</td><td>1寸 / 3寸 / 6寸</td></tr>\n<tr><td>认证</td><td>ISO 9001, ISO 14001, OHSMS 18000</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>颜色与印刷选项</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>透明、金色、银色、红色、黄色、白色、黑色及全彩</li>\n<li>油墨印刷logo、激光/全息效果、定制品牌/语言印刷</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>应用领域</h3>\n<p>烟草、食品包装、茶叶、保健食品、药品、文具、影音产品、扑克、蚊香圈、防伪封签、快递信封撕拉线、香水盒、化妆品盒、安全套盒等。</p>",
