      "descEn": "<h2>BOPP / BOPET Laser / Holographic Tear Tape</h2>\n<p>AEC GROUP supplies professional tear tape (tear strip) lines used for the opening of cigarette packs, biscuit boxes, chewing gum bags, medicine pieces, garments, CDs, and other packed goods. Materials: BOPP, BOPET, VMOPP.</p>\n<h3>Types</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>General Tear Tape</strong> — Widely used in cigarettes, playing cards, pharmaceutical and audio-visual packaging. Transparent, colour-printed or logo-printed. Affordable plate-making, clear text/logo, excellent adhesion and peel strength, smooth unwinding.</li>\n<li><strong>Shrinkage Tear Tape</strong> — For cigarette hard-pack, poker, drugs and audio-visual packaging. Shrinkage characteristic keeps packaging neat and orderly; good adhesion, smooth unwinding.</li>\n<li><strong>Anti-Counterfeiting (Holographic) Tear Tape</strong> — For premium cigarettes, poker and pharmaceutical packaging. Three-dimensional laser effects moulded into the film; first choice for high-end cigarette packs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Technical Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Specification</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Material</td><td>BOPP / BOPET / VMOPP</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Thickness</td><td>25–40 µm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Width</td><td>1.2 mm – 8.5 mm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Roll Length</td><td>5,000 m – 120,000 m per spool</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Inner Core</td><td>1″ / 3″ / 6″</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Certification</td><td>ISO 9001, ISO 14001, OHSMS 18000</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3>Colour & Printing Options</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Transparent (clear), Golden, Silver, Red, Yellow, White, Black, Full-colour</li>\n<li>Ink-printed logo, Laser/holographic effect, Custom brand / country-language printing</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Standard Sizes (Clear Tear Tape)</h3>\n<p>1.6 mm, 1.8 mm, 2.0 mm, 2.5 mm, 3.0 mm, 3.5 mm, 5.0 mm, 8.0 mm × 10,000 m<br>\nLength options: 5,000 m / 6,000 m / 12,000 m / 18,000 m / 24,000 m / 36,000 m / 75,000 m / 120,000 m</p>\n<h3>Applications</h3>\n<p>Cigarettes, food packaging, tea, health food, medicines, stationery, audio/video products, poker, mosquito-repellent coils, anti-counterfeit seals, express envelope tear strips, perfume boxes, cosmetics boxes, condom boxes.</p>\n<h3>Packaging</h3>\n<p>Inner: soft bags. Outer: cartons, 16 rolls/carton. Weight: ≈ 0.72 kg net / 0.86 kg gross per roll (1.6 mm × 10,000 m).</p>",
      "descZh": "<h2>BOPP/BOPET自粘撕拉带</h2>\n<p>AEC GROUP供应专业撕拉带（撕裂带）产品，广泛用于烟盒、饼干盒、口香糖袋、药品、服装、CD等包装的开启。材质：BOPP、BOPET、VMOPP。</p>\n<h3>产品类型</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>普通撕拉带</strong> — 广泛用于烟草、扑克牌、药品及影音产品包装。透明、印色或印刷logo。制版经济实惠，文字/logo清晰，具有良好的持粘强度和剥离强度，放卷流畅。</li>\n<li><strong>收缩撕拉带</strong> — 适用于烟草硬包、扑克、药品及影音包装。具有收缩特性，使包装更整洁规范，提升产品品质。</li>\n<li><strong>防伪（全息）撕拉带</strong> — 适用于高档香烟、扑克及药品包装。由原膜模压制成三维激光效果，具有防伪功能，是烟盒高端包装的首选。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>技术规格</h3>\n<table>\n<tr><th>参数</th><th>规格</th></tr>\n<tr><td>材质</td><td>BOPP / BOPET / VMOPP</td></tr>\n<tr><td>厚度</td><td>25–40 µm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>宽度</td><td>1.2 mm – 8.5 mm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>卷长</td><td>5,000 m – 120,000 m/卷</td></tr>\n<tr><td>内芯</td><td>1寸 / 3寸 / 6寸</td></tr>\n<tr><td>认证</td><td>ISO 9001, ISO 14001, OHSMS 18000</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3>颜色与印刷选项</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>透明、金色、银色、红色、黄色、白色、黑色及全彩</li>\n<li>油墨印刷logo、激光/全息效果、定制品牌/语言印刷</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>应用领域</h3>\n<p>烟草、食品包装、茶叶、保健食品、药品、文具、影音产品、扑克、蚊香圈、防伪封签、快递信封撕拉线、香水盒、化妆品盒、安全套盒等。</p>",
