      "descEn": "<h2><!--StartFragment--><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\" style=\"line-height: 36px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\">BOPP/BOPET self adhesive tear tape lines were for packing/opening of cigarette packs and other packs</span><p style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\" style=\"line-height: 36px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\">Various sizes for adhesive tear tape:</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\" style=\"line-height: 36px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\">a) Thickness of tear tape: 25-40UM b) Width of tear tape rolls: 1.6mm-6.0mm</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\" style=\"line-height: 36px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\">c) Length of tear tape rolls: 5,000m-70,000m</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\" style=\"line-height: 36px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\">2) Printing design: a) Color printing of tear tape rolls: gold, single gold, single silver, full solid red,&nbsp;</span><br>\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\" style=\"line-height: 36px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\">yellow,white,black, etc. b) Logo printing of tear tape rolls: ink printing logo, laser, holographic effect</span></p><p style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">\n<span data-mce-style=\"font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\" style=\"line-height: 36px; font-family: Calibri, 'zapf dingbats'; font-size: 24px;\">3.) Packing for of tear tape rolls: Cartons (16rolls/carton)</span></p><!--EndFragment--></h2>",
      "descZh": "<h2>BOPP/BOPET自粘撕拉带</h2>\n<p>AEC GROUP供应专业撕拉带（撕裂带）产品，广泛用于烟盒、饼干盒、口香糖袋、药品、服装、CD等包装的开启。材质：BOPP、BOPET、VMOPP。</p>\n<h3>产品类型</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>普通撕拉带</strong> — 广泛用于烟草、扑克牌、药品及影音产品包装。透明、印色或印刷logo。制版经济实惠，文字/logo清晰，具有良好的持粘强度和剥离强度，放卷流畅。</li>\n<li><strong>收缩撕拉带</strong> — 适用于烟草硬包、扑克、药品及影音包装。具有收缩特性，使包装更整洁规范，提升产品品质。</li>\n<li><strong>防伪（全息）撕拉带</strong> — 适用于高档香烟、扑克及药品包装。由原膜模压制成三维激光效果，具有防伪功能，是烟盒高端包装的首选。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>技术规格</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr><th>参数</th><th>规格</th></tr>\n<tr><td>材质</td><td>BOPP / BOPET / VMOPP</td></tr>\n<tr><td>厚度</td><td>25–40 µm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>宽度</td><td>1.2 mm – 8.5 mm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>卷长</td><td>5,000 m – 120,000 m/卷</td></tr>\n<tr><td>内芯</td><td>1寸 / 3寸 / 6寸</td></tr>\n<tr><td>认证</td><td>ISO 9001, ISO 14001, OHSMS 18000</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>颜色与印刷选项</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>透明、金色、银色、红色、黄色、白色、黑色及全彩</li>\n<li>油墨印刷logo、激光/全息效果、定制品牌/语言印刷</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>应用领域</h3>\n<p>烟草、食品包装、茶叶、保健食品、药品、文具、影音产品、扑克、蚊香圈、防伪封签、快递信封撕拉线、香水盒、化妆品盒、安全套盒等。</p>",
