      "descEn": "<h2><!--StartFragment-->A4 Copy Paper for office applications&nbsp;<br>\nGrammage: 70 ,75,80 GSM <br>\nSize : 8.5\"*11\",A4,8.5\"*13\",A3,11\"*17\", 22\"*34\"and foolscap paper sheet is 17 x 13.5inches (432x343 mm) .<br>\nBrightness: 95%-96%,98%-102%,106%-108%<br>\nWood pulp: 100% actual wooden pulp (woodfre) <br>\nPackage: 500sheets/ream, 5reams/carton 7800-8250reasms/20GP without pallet<br>\nDelivery date : within 10 days&nbsp; . <br>\nSpecification for Copy Paper <br>\nItem 75 GSM 8.5X 14 <br>\nMaterial wood pulp %&nbsp;&nbsp; <br>\nCEI Whiteness 148-152 <br>\nWhiteness &gt; &gt;98% <br>\nBrightness % ≥ 101-104% <br>\nOpacity %≥ &gt;94 <br>\nSmoothness Front&nbsp; ≥&nbsp;&nbsp; <br>\nSmoothness Back&nbsp; ≥&nbsp;&nbsp; <br>\nSurface Roughness TS ml/min 75-175 <br>\nSurface Roughness BS ml/min 100-200 <br>\nBending stiffness MD &gt; &gt;110Mn <br>\nBending stiffness CD &gt; &gt;50Mn <br>\nVariation of two sides % ≤&nbsp;&nbsp; <br>\nSizing (mm) ≥&nbsp;&nbsp; <br>\nAsh %&nbsp;&nbsp; <br>\nMoisture content % 3.5-4.5 <br>\nTightness (g/cm3) ≤&nbsp;&nbsp; <br>\nSurface strength (m/s) ≥&nbsp;&nbsp; <br>\nDust / Dirt (piece/m2) ≤&nbsp;&nbsp; <br>\nPH Value&nbsp; 0A <br>\nCOBB Test g/m2&nbsp; 27-33 <br>\nSurface absorption g/m2&nbsp;&nbsp;<!--EndFragment--></h2><table><tbody>\n</tbody></table>",
      "descZh": "<h2>A4/信纸/法律文件尺寸复印纸 — 70、75、80 GSM</h2>\n<p>AEC GROUP拥有四条生产线，月总产量约8,000吨。原材料（木浆）来自俄罗斯、智利等地。复印纸采用100%实际木浆，提供三个品质等级。</p>\n<h3>品质等级</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr><th>等级</th><th>浆料</th><th>白度</th><th>定位</th></tr>\n<tr><td>A级</td><td>混合木浆</td><td>94%–96%</td><td>经济型</td></tr>\n<tr><td>A+级</td><td>100%木浆</td><td>98%–100%</td><td>优质型</td></tr>\n<tr><td>A++级</td><td>100%木浆</td><td>104%–106%</td><td>超优质型</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>技术数据（80 GSM，A++级）</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr><th>指标</th><th>数值</th></tr>\n<tr><td>克重</td><td>70 / 75 / 80 g/m²</td></tr>\n<tr><td>厚度</td><td>103–110 µm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>CIE白度</td><td>148–152</td></tr>\n<tr><td>亮度</td><td>101–104%</td></tr>\n<tr><td>不透明度</td><td>&gt;94%</td></tr>\n<tr><td>水分</td><td>3.5%–4.5%</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>规格尺寸</h3>\n<p>A4（210×297 mm）、Letter（216×279 mm）、Legal（216×330 mm）、A3（420×297 mm）、大卷（宽度可达1500 mm）</p>\n<h3>包装</h3>\n<p>500张/令，5令/箱。纸箱：310×220×240 mm。最小订量：1×20GP集装箱。大批量订单可定制令纸包装及纸箱印刷。</p>",
