      "descEn": "<h2><font size=\"3\">Copy Paper Jumbo Rolls<br></font><p><font size=\"3\">We are one of the fewer factories who can offer only Copy paper jumbo\n roll&nbsp; products with GRM is from 48 GRM to 100GRM with outstanding \nquality . We import the raw mateiral(wooden pulp) from overseas like \nRussia and other area .Also we are one of the fewer factories who can \noffer only LWC paper products in quality actual 100% wooden pulp .</font></p><!--EndFragment--></h2>\n<p><font size=\"3\">AEC GROUP supplies photocopy paper in jumbo roll form, ready to be sheeted into A4, A3, Letter and Legal sizes. Basis weight range: 48–100 g/m². Raw material: 100% wood pulp imported from Russia and other regions.</font></p>\n<h3><font size=\"3\">Jumbo Roll Specifications</font></h3>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr><th><font size=\"3\">Parameter</font></th><th><font size=\"3\">Value</font></th></tr>\n<tr><td><font size=\"3\">Basis Weight</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">48–100 g/m² (typically 70, 75, 80 GSM)</font></td></tr>\n<tr><td><font size=\"3\">Max Width</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">1,500 mm</font></td></tr>\n<tr><td><font size=\"3\">Max Roll Diameter</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">600–1,200 mm</font></td></tr>\n<tr><td><font size=\"3\">Max Roll Weight</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">2,000 kg</font></td></tr>\n<tr><td><font size=\"3\">Inner Core</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">76 mm (3″) / 152.4 mm (6″)</font></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3><font size=\"3\">Economy Grade Technical Data</font></h3>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr><th><font size=\"3\">Property</font></th><th><font size=\"3\">Economy</font></th><th><font size=\"3\">Allround</font></th></tr>\n<tr><td><font size=\"3\">Grammage</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">80 ± 3 g/m²</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">80 ± 3 g/m²</font></td></tr>\n<tr><td><font size=\"3\">Caliper</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">106 ± 4 mm/1000</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">106 ± 3 mm/1000</font></td></tr>\n<tr><td><font size=\"3\">Stiffness MD</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">min 100 mN</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">min 125 ± 15 mN</font></td></tr>\n<tr><td><font size=\"3\">Stiffness CD</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">min 40 mN</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">min 60 ± 10 mN</font></td></tr>\n<tr><td><font size=\"3\">CIE Whiteness</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">146 ± 3</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">160 ± 3</font></td></tr>\n<tr><td><font size=\"3\">Brightness (UV)</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">103.5 ± 1.5%</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">110 ± 1.5%</font></td></tr>\n<tr><td><font size=\"3\">Opacity</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">min 90%</font></td><td><font size=\"3\">min 91%</font></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3><font size=\"3\">Applications</font></h3>\n<p><font size=\"3\">Sheeting mills, paper converters, and office supply distributors who wish to cut to standard A4/A3/Letter/Legal reams on their own slitting/sheeting equipment.</font></p>",
