      "descEn": "<h2>A4 / Letter / Legal Copy Paper — 70, 75, 80 GSM</h2>\n<p>AEC GROUP operates four production lines with a total monthly output of approximately 8,000 tons. Raw materials (wood pulp) are sourced from Russia, Chile and other regions. Our copy paper uses 100% actual wood-free pulp, offering three quality grades.</p>\n<h3>Quality Grades</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><th>Pulp Type</th><th>Brightness</th><th>Classification</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Grade A</td><td>Mixed wood pulp</td><td>94%–96%</td><td>Economy</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Grade A+</td><td>100% wood-free pulp</td><td>98%–100%</td><td>Premium</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Grade A++</td><td>100% wood-free pulp</td><td>104%–106%</td><td>Super Premium</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>Technical Data (80 GSM, A++ Grade)</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr><th>Property</th><th>Value</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Basis Weight</td><td>70 / 75 / 80 g/m²</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Thickness</td><td>103–110 µm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Whiteness (CIE)</td><td>148–152</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Brightness</td><td>101–104%</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Opacity</td><td>&gt; 94%</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Moisture</td><td>3.5%–4.5%</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Roughness (Bendtsen) TS</td><td>75–175 ml/min</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Bending Stiffness MD</td><td>&gt; 110 mN</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Bending Stiffness CD</td><td>&gt; 50 mN</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Cobb Test</td><td>27–33 g/m²</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>Available Sizes</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr><th>Size</th><th>Dimensions</th></tr>\n<tr><td>A4</td><td>210 × 297 mm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Letter (8.5″ × 11″)</td><td>216 × 279 mm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Legal (8.5″ × 13″)</td><td>216 × 330 mm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>A3</td><td>420 × 297 mm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Jumbo roll</td><td>Custom widths up to 1500 mm</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>Packaging</h3>\n<p>500 sheets/ream, 5 reams/carton. Carton: 310 × 220 × 240 mm. Pallet: 1120 × 960 × 130 mm.<br>\nA4 80GSM: 400 reams/ton. Min. order: 1 × 20GP container. Custom ream wrapper and carton logo available for volume orders.</p>\n<h3>Performance Highlights</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>No paper jam; no double feed</li>\n<li>Stays flat after copying; leaves no dust in machines</li>\n<li>Compatible with photocopiers, laser printers, inkjet printers and fax machines</li>\n<li>White, clean appearance; smooth and bulky touch; good opacity for double-sided printing</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Container Loading (A4, 80 GSM)</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr><th>Container</th><th>Reams</th><th>Net Weight</th></tr>\n<tr><td>20GP (no pallets)</td><td>7,800</td><td>≈ 18,500 kg</td></tr>\n<tr><td>40GP (with pallets)</td><td>11,840</td><td>≈ 26,000 kg</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>",
      "descZh": "<h2>A4/信纸/法律文件尺寸复印纸 — 70、75、80 GSM</h2>\n<p>AEC GROUP拥有四条生产线，月总产量约8,000吨。原材料（木浆）来自俄罗斯、智利等地。复印纸采用100%实际木浆，提供三个品质等级。</p>\n<h3>品质等级</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr><th>等级</th><th>浆料</th><th>白度</th><th>定位</th></tr>\n<tr><td>A级</td><td>混合木浆</td><td>94%–96%</td><td>经济型</td></tr>\n<tr><td>A+级</td><td>100%木浆</td><td>98%–100%</td><td>优质型</td></tr>\n<tr><td>A++级</td><td>100%木浆</td><td>104%–106%</td><td>超优质型</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>技术数据（80 GSM，A++级）</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr><th>指标</th><th>数值</th></tr>\n<tr><td>克重</td><td>70 / 75 / 80 g/m²</td></tr>\n<tr><td>厚度</td><td>103–110 µm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>CIE白度</td><td>148–152</td></tr>\n<tr><td>亮度</td><td>101–104%</td></tr>\n<tr><td>不透明度</td><td>&gt;94%</td></tr>\n<tr><td>水分</td><td>3.5%–4.5%</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>规格尺寸</h3>\n<p>A4（210×297 mm）、Letter（216×279 mm）、Legal（216×330 mm）、A3（420×297 mm）、大卷（宽度可达1500 mm）</p>\n<h3>包装</h3>\n<p>500张/令，5令/箱。纸箱：310×220×240 mm。最小订量：1×20GP集装箱。大批量订单可定制令纸包装及纸箱印刷。</p>",
