      "descEn": "<h2><font size=\"3\">LWC Paper — Light Weight Coated Paper</font></h2>\n<p><font size=\"3\">LWC (Light Weight Coated Paper) is a coated printing paper with a basis weight of 48–100 g/m². AEC sources 100% wood pulp from Russia, Chile and other regions, ensuring outstanding printing quality and surface smoothness.<br></font><!--StartFragment--></p><div><font size=\"3\">LWC paper is called as Low weight coated paper or light weight coated paper.</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Which GRM is from 48 GRM to 100GRM with actual 100% wooden pulp (outstanding&nbsp;quality) .&nbsp;<br>We import the raw mateiral(wooden pulp) from overseas like Russia,Chile and other areas.<br>Our tech data for this goods following :</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Brightness(ISO) : 84 % . Opacity : 90% GlossTS 43% , Gloss BS 43%</font></div><p></p><div><font size=\"3\">Size :&nbsp;In roll --- 760-1050*11000. In big sheet---889*1194,787*1092.</font></div><p><!--EndFragment--><!--StartFragment--><span style=\"  font-size: 13.5pt\">LWC, \ncalled Light Weight Coated Paper. It refers to a class of low weight \ncoated paper processing, generally in the 40-90g/m2. This kind of paper \nfront and back are coated with a layer of thin coating (composed of \ncalcium carbonate and cationic starch), and then through a super \ncalendar so as to improve its physical properties and printability. The \nchemical composition of this paper, the long fiber bleached softwood \nchemical pulp 40%; mechanical wood pulp accounted for 60%. <br>The performance of paper <br>\n1. This kind of paper between the performance of coated paper and offset\n paper, the effect of its color printing comparable to coated paper, and\n its opacity, smoothness, gloss and printability is good.&nbsp;<br>\n2. This kind of paper and low cost. It costs between the coated paper \nand offset paper between. However, the printing quality can be achieved \ncomparable with the effect of coated paper, so a high value-added paper.<br>\n3. However, the durability of this paper is small, so the long-term retention of printed materials is not easy.&nbsp;<br>Usage:<br>\nThis paper is mainly used for printing magazines, catalogs, advertising, trademarks, newspaper inserts and so on.</span></p><ul>\n</ul>\n<h3>Applications</h3>\n<p>Commercial printing, magazines, catalogues, leaflets, inserts, direct-mail flyers, and packaging printing requiring coated-paper surface quality at reduced paper weight.</p>",
      "descZh": "<h2>LWC轻量涂布纸</h2>\n<p>LWC（轻量涂布纸）克重范围为48–100 g/m²，原材料来自俄罗斯、智利等地的100%木浆，印刷质量及表面平滑度优异。</p>\n<h3>技术规格</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr><th>指标</th><th>数值</th></tr>\n<tr><td>克重</td><td>48–100 g/m²（常用60、70、80 GSM）</td></tr>\n<tr><td>白度（ISO）</td><td>84%</td></tr>\n<tr><td>不透明度</td><td>90%</td></tr>\n<tr><td>光泽度（正面/背面）</td><td>43%</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>供货规格</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>卷装：760–1050 mm × 11,000 m</li>\n<li>平张：889×1194 mm / 787×1092 mm</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>应用领域</h3>\n<p>商业印刷、杂志、目录册、宣传单张、包装印刷等需要涂布纸表面质量同时降低纸张克重的应用。</p>",
