      "descEn": "<h2>Self-Adhesive Labels</h2>\n<p>AEC GROUP supplies a full range of self-adhesive label materials and finished labels for industrial, commercial and retail applications. Also known as pressure-sensitive labels or sticker labels.</p>\n<h3>Surface Material Types</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Paper substrates:</strong> Offset paper, coated paper, glassine, kraft paper, laser paper, fluorescent paper, gold/silver foil, aluminium foil, fragile (tamper-evident) paper, textured paper, Tyvek/nylon fabric, pearl paper.</li>\n<li><strong>Film substrates:</strong> Transparent PVC, Polyester (PET), Polypropylene (PP/OPP), Polycarbonate (PC), Synthetic paper, PE, shape-memory security material (SMP).</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Adhesive Types</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Universal permanent adhesive</li>\n<li>Strong permanent adhesive (frozen food grade)</li>\n<li>Removable adhesive (fibre re-open type)</li>\n<li>Washable adhesive (for beer labels, tableware, fruit)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Applications by Material</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr><th>Material</th><th>Typical Applications</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Coated paper</td><td>Medicine, food, cooking oil, wine, drinks, appliances</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Mirror-coated paper</td><td>High-gloss pharmaceutical &amp; beverage labels</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Aluminium foil</td><td>High-end medicines, food, cultural goods</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Fragile (security) paper</td><td>Electronics, mobile phones, medicine seals</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Thermal paper</td><td>Price tags, retail, variable-data printing</td></tr>\n<tr><td>PET film</td><td>Toiletries, cosmetics, high-temperature products</td></tr>\n<tr><td>OPP / PP film</td><td>Toiletries, cosmetics — thermal-transfer printable</td></tr>\n<tr><td>PVC shrink film</td><td>Battery trademark labels</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>Release Liner</h3>\n<p>White/blue/yellow glassine, garlic vellum, kraft paper, PET, coated paper, or PE release liner.</p>\n<h3>Available Formats</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Self-adhesive labels in rolls (continuous)</li>\n<li>Self-adhesive labels in sheets (die-cut)</li>\n<li>Custom sizes, shapes and printing available (OEM/ODM)</li>\n</ul>",
      "descZh": "<h2>自粘标签</h2>\n<p>AEC GROUP供应全系列自粘标签材料及成品标签，适用于工业、商业及零售等各类应用。亦称压敏标签或不干胶标签。</p>\n<h3>面材类型</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>纸质面材：</strong>胶版纸、铜版纸、玻璃纸、牛皮纸、激光纸、荧光纸、金/银卡纸、铝箔、易碎（防伪）纸、纹理纸、特卫强/尼龙布、珠光纸。</li>\n<li><strong>薄膜面材：</strong>透明PVC、聚酯（PET）、聚丙烯（PP/OPP）、聚碳酸酯（PC）、合成纸、PE、形状记忆防伪材料（SMP）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>胶水类型</h3>\n<ul><li>通用型永久胶 / 强力永久胶（冷冻食品级）/ 可移除胶 / 可水洗胶</li></ul>\n<h3>应用领域</h3>\n<p>药品、食品、食用油、酒水饮料、家电、化妆品、电池商标、价格标签、快递包裹等。</p>\n<h3>供应规格</h3>\n<ul><li>卷装自粘标签（连续卷）</li><li>片材自粘标签（模切成形）</li><li>支持OEM/ODM定制尺寸、形状及印刷</li></ul>",
